#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:5
#: fecf75e9e951476cab8450dd8ffa55b4
msgid "MAVLink Routing in ArduPilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中的 MAVLink 路由"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:7
#: eea211844ce847569896182cca165efc
msgid ""
"ArduPilot (which runs on the flight controller) can route MAVLink messages "
"received on one telemetry port to all other telemetry ports.  This is "
"important in cases where there are multiple MAVLink enabled components on "
"the vehicle (i.e. a flight controller and a companion computer) but only a "
"single telemetry connection between the vehicle and the ground station.  "
"This page describes how ArduPilot decides which messages should be routed "
"and to which telemetry ports."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot（运行于飞控板）可以将一个数传端口上收到的 MAVLink 消息路由到所有其他数传端口。当飞行器上有多个 MAVLink "
"组件（如飞控和伴随计算机），而飞行器与地面站之间只有一个数传连接时，这一功能尤为重要。本页描述了 ArduPilot "
"如何决定哪些消息应被路由以及路由到哪个数传端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:13
#: 6e4ac7f530d148d99648430c40562eef
msgid ""
"As described on the :ref:`MAVLink Basics <mavlink-basics>` page a MAVLink "
"network is made up of *systems* (vehicles, GCS, antenna trackers, etc) which"
" are themselves made up of *components* (flight controller, camera system, "
"etc)."
msgstr ""
"如 :ref:`MAVLink 基础 <mavlink-basics>` 页面所述，MAVLink 网络由 *系统* "
"（飞行器、地面站、天线追踪器等）组成，每个系统又由 *组件* （飞控、相机系统等）构成。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:15
#: 30b0dca876f6486498e15d3776fcbf11
msgid ""
"Each message contains a ``System ID`` and ``Component ID`` field to specify "
"where the message came from.  In addition *some messages* (including "
"`SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT>`__)"
" include ``target_system`` and ``target_component`` fields to allow "
"specifying which system/component should execute the command."
msgstr ""
"每条消息包含 ``System ID`` 和 ``Component ID`` 字段，用于指明消息来源。此外，*部分消息* （包括 "
"`SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_GLOBAL_INT>`__）还包含"
" ``target_system`` 和 ``target_component`` 字段，以指定应执行该命令的系统/组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:17
#: a7087eeb00df45e893f7fe523153e303
msgid ""
"A value of 0 for the ``target_system`` or ``target_component`` is considered"
" a broadcast ID, and will be sent to all systems in the network/components "
"on the target system."
msgstr ""
"``target_system`` 或 ``target_component`` 值为 0 时视为广播 "
"ID，将发送至网络中的所有系统/目标系统上的所有组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:21
#: fe01ae9a4afb4153ac74c8cd42120509
msgid "The routing on ArduPilot systems works in the following way:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 系统中的路由规则如下："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:23
#: c221c31e9bb34c48a2799fe4a117ca7c
msgid ""
"All received MAVLink messages are checked by the `MAVLink_routing "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/GCS_MAVLink/MAVLink_routing.h>`__"
" class."
msgstr ""
"所有收到的 MAVLink 消息均由 `MAVLink_routing "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/GCS_MAVLink/MAVLink_routing.h>`__"
" 类进行检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:24
#: 019b0c1abcbb4e889e1fe2768b2dc309
msgid ""
"The class extracts the source system id (aka *sysid*) and component id (aka "
"*compid*) and builds up a routing array which maps the channel (i.e. USB "
"port, Telem1, Telem2) to the *<sysid,compid>* pair."
msgstr ""
"该类提取源系统 ID（即 *sysid*）和组件 ID（即 *compid*），并构建一个路由数组，将通道（如 USB "
"端口、Telem1、Telem2）映射到 *<sysid,compid>* 对。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:25
#: c3959dbccadf4142a986d6d6dd3a9029
msgid ""
"The class also extracts the target system id (``target_system``) and "
"component id (``target_component``) and if these don’t match the vehicle’s "
"*<sysid,compid>* the messages are forwarded to the appropriate channel using"
" the array above."
msgstr ""
"该类还提取目标系统 ID（``target_system``）和组件 ID（``target_component``），若与飞行器的 "
"*<sysid,compid>* 不匹配，则使用上述数组将消息转发到适当通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:26
#: 7f5e033eca264a1da71cf872b65b68b1
msgid ""
"Messages that don’t have a target *<sysid,compid>* are processed by the "
"vehicle and then forwarded to each known system/component."
msgstr "没有目标 *<sysid,compid>* 的消息由飞行器处理后转发给每个已知的系统/组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:29
#: 99914a8bb1024067999ff8fb4c8b6d5a
msgid "Detailed theory of MAVLink routing"
msgstr "MAVLink 路由详细原理"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:31
#: 2029c32727da44a68752e2d85ce0813f
