msgstr "当飞控收到消息时，若满足以下任意条件，应在本地处理该消息："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:52
#: 33e4c2572d754902ad2d00fcd9bed052 5f29a28913d745e9836c7c8ce589150c
msgid "It has no ``target_system`` field"
msgstr "消息没有 ``target_system`` 字段"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:53
#: 2a247f61e66647feb4d94a7ee40879ca 879b3a1e3dee465fa1b7b3f6107c0a63
msgid "It has a ``target_system`` of zero"
msgstr "消息的 ``target_system`` 为零"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:40
#: 8af6cdfbb25543e3a921f5155317a765
msgid ""
"It has the flight controllers target system and has no ``target_component`` "
"field"
msgstr "消息的目标系统与飞控匹配，且没有 ``target_component`` 字段"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:42
#: 2f1dc3806e0b4ba193fe8aa4aa210051
msgid ""
"It has the flight controllers target system and has the flight controllers "
"``target_component``"
msgstr "消息的目标系统与飞控匹配，且 ``target_component`` 也与飞控匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:44
#: 9ce782a5df6442f386b4daadf4e3deec
msgid ""
"It has the flight controllers target system and the flight controller has "
"not seen any messages on any of its links from a system that has the "
"messages ``target_system``/``target_component`` combination"
msgstr ""
"消息的目标系统与飞控匹配，且飞控在其所有链路上均未收到过来自该消息的 ``target_system``/``target_component`` "
"组合的消息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:49
#: 9740e15eb16c4ed59d72c6ae33340d41
msgid ""
"When a flight controller receives a message it should forward it onto "
"another different link if any of these conditions hold for that link:"
msgstr "当飞控收到消息时，若某链路满足以下任意条件，应将消息转发到该链路："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:54
#: 4d06a4cf3e2c4fb28e8f9e3929229099
msgid ""
"It does not have the flight controllers ``target_system`` and the flight "
"controller has seen a message from the messages ``target_system`` on the "
"link"
msgstr "消息不含飞控的 ``target_system``，且飞控已在该链路上看到过来自该消息 ``target_system`` 的消息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:57
#: b3a9759ecb2041f7b48954484e747fa2
msgid ""
"It has the flight controllers ``target_system`` and has a "
"``target_component`` field and the flight controllers has seen a message "
"from the ``target_system``/``target_component`` combination on the link"
msgstr ""
"消息含有飞控的 ``target_system`` 和 ``target_component`` 字段，且飞控已在该链路上看到过来自该 "
"``target_system``/``target_component`` 组合的消息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:64
#: 8e998ae372c4428fa59012595452c448
msgid ""
"This proposal assumes that ground stations will not send command packets to "
"a non-broadcast destination (sysid/compid combination) until they have "
"received at least one package from that destination over the link. This is "
"essential to prevent a flight controller from acting on a message that is "
"not meant for it. For example, a ``PARAM_SET`` cannot be sent to a specific "
"*<sysid/compid>* combination until the GCS has seen a packet from that "
"*<sysid/compid>* combination on the link."
msgstr ""
"本方案假设地面站在通过链路收到来自某非广播目标（sysid/compid "
"组合）的至少一个数据包之前，不会向该目标发送命令包。这对于防止飞控处理非面向自身的消息至关重要。例如，在地面站通过链路收到来自某 "
"*<sysid/compid>* 组合的数据包之前，不能向该组合发送 ``PARAM_SET``。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-routing-in-ardupilot.rst:72
#: 2e94b3e8cbad4936868a8bf4c3c78cc0
msgid ""
"The GCS must also reset what\\ *<sysid/compid>* combinations it has seen on "
"a link when it sees a SYSTEM_TIME message with a decrease in time_boot_ms "
"from a particular *<sysid/compid>*. That is essential to detect a reset of "
"the flight controller, which implies a reset of its routing table."
msgstr ""
"当地面站收到来自某 *<sysid/compid>* 的 SYSTEM_TIME 消息且 time_boot_ms "
"减小时，地面站还必须重置在该链路上已见过的 *<sysid/compid>* 组合。这对检测飞控重置（意味着路由表重置）至关重要。"
